{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05121","headline":"夏日梁王席送张岐州 · 沈佺期","name":"夏日梁王席送张岐州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦鸡常下雍，周凤昔鸣岐。\n此地推雄抚，惟良寄在斯。\n家传七豹贵，人擅八龙奇。\n高传生光彩，长林叹别离。\n天人开祖席，朝寀候征麾。\n翠帟当郊敞，彤幨向野披。\n芃芃秋麦盛，苒苒夏条垂。\n奏计何时入？台阶望羽仪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05121.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05121","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}